# the HOME screen after PRESETS clicks shows the instrument that sounds (1.0.3: a quick run of clicks, or one
# click to a name with the same first letter, left the old name beside the new kanji). The oracle: the same
# screen after a forced redraw (another page and back).
wait 300
turn PRESET 1 250
wait 1500
expect par7 1
snap one
tap FX
tap HOME
wait 100
expect screen one
turn PRESET 2 250
wait 1500
expect par7 3
snap three
tap FX
tap HOME
wait 100
expect screen three
